[
  {"comment": "A chamfer as wide as the face beside it (mitcad#1783). A disc 63 across and 3 thick (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2, Body1) with a regular octagon prism on it from z = 3 to 20 (Sketch2 F3, Extrude2 F4, joined) whose corners lie on the disc's rim: the disc's top is left as eight segments F2:end(r{c1})#0..#7 between the octagon's sides and the rim, each 31.5 (1 - cos 22.5 deg) = 2.397795 wide at its side's middle and ending in a point at the corners."},
  {"cmd": "add_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 2.4},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 63},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 3}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [31.5, 0], "end": [22.273863607376, 22.273863607376]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [22.273863607376, 22.273863607376], "end": [0, 31.5]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [0, 31.5], "end": [-22.273863607376, 22.273863607376]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [-22.273863607376, 22.273863607376], "end": [-31.5, 0]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [-31.5, 0], "end": [-22.273863607376, -22.273863607376]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [-22.273863607376, -22.273863607376], "end": [0, -31.5]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [0, -31.5], "end": [22.273863607376, -22.273863607376]},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_line", "sketch": "F3", "start": [22.273863607376, -22.273863607376], "end": [31.5, 0]},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c22,c4],c4[c1,c7],c7[c4,c10],c10[c7,c13],c13[c10,c16],c16[c13,c19],c19[c16,c22],c22[c19,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 3}, "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 17}, "operation": "join"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Extrude2", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 57062.351779, "faces": 19,
    "has_face": "F2:end(r{c1})#5"}},

  {"comment": "Chamfer1 (F5): the octagon's eight feet bevelled by `bevel` = 2.4, a little wider than the segments: it takes them away, cut by the rim (the disc's side grown up to it), at its size with no warning or information. Its volume: the base's and, for each side, the integral over the segment (x from the side at a = 31.5 cos 22.5 deg out to the rim) of (d + a - x) 2 sqrt(R^2 - x^2). Each foot's chamfer face is named after the foot. Before, it was built 0.1 % smaller, crumpled at the corners."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "chamfer", "body": "F2.b0",
    "edges": ["E{F2:end(r{c1})#0|F4:side(c13[c10,c16])}", "E{F2:end(r{c1})#1|F4:side(c10[c7,c13])}",
              "E{F2:end(r{c1})#2|F4:side(c16[c13,c19])}", "E{F2:end(r{c1})#3|F4:side(c7[c4,c10])}",
              "E{F2:end(r{c1})#4|F4:side(c19[c16,c22])}", "E{F2:end(r{c1})#5|F4:side(c4[c1,c7])}",
              "E{F2:end(r{c1})#6|F4:side(c22[c19,c1])}", "E{F2:end(r{c1})#7|F4:side(c1[c22,c4])}"],
    "size": {"type": "equal_distance", "distance": "bevel"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57509.095137, "faces": 19,
    "has_face": "F5:chamfer(E{F2:end(r{c1})#5|F4:side(c4[c1,c7])})"}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},

  {"comment": "Exactly as wide as the segments at their middles (2.397794725894), and 1e-3 wider: the same clean result."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 2.397794725894},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57508.409874, "faces": 19}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 2.398794725894},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57508.720612, "faces": 19}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},

  {"comment": "1e-3 narrower: the exact chamfer would leave a sliver of about 3e-4 mm2 of each segment by its side's middle; narrower than 0.1 % of the chamfer, it is taken away with the segment (the volume within 1e-9 of the exact shape's)."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 2.396794725894},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57508.099136, "faces": 19}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}},

  {"comment": "2 and 3: narrower, the segments' middles stay (eight faces more), the chamfer cut by the rim near the corners; clearly wider, as 2.4."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 2},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57388.175083, "faces": 27,
    "has_face": "F2:end(r{c1})#5"}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "bevel", "value": 3},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Chamfer1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body1", "volume": 57695.538235, "faces": 19}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F5"}, "result": {"status": "ok", "level": null}}}
]
